summary: An 8-specialist panel on the founder's "CLI verifiably true before GUI" sequencing returned 8/8 ENDORSE on the sequencing but 8/8 REJECT on the gate ("the team believes"), and coordinator-verification of their numbers exposed that this repo has never produced a contested verdict. Founder then set a universal cold-agent usability constraint (TD-2026-07-21-766), pre-registered as falsifier F4; refusal:v1 SP0+SP1 and over-block stage 1 were built and committed. A second 5-agent panel ranked the next move UNANIMOUSLY as producing the first contested verdict — with three of five ranking their own lane below it.
